			<td class="text" valign="top">
				<!-- InstanceBeginEditable name="Content" --><br>
				<h2 align="center">The Station.com Prize Games 2002<br>
				Official Rules</h2>
				<h3 align="center">No Purchase Necessary to Enter or Win!</h3>
				<h4 align="center">The terms of these Station.com Prize Games 2002 will apply 
				for the period from June 3, 2002, at 12:01 p.m. through December 30, 
				2002, at 12:00 p.m. Check back here in advance of December 30, 2002, 
				for Station.com Prize Games promotions available thereafter. </h4>
				<p>1.	<b>Eligibility</b></p>
				<blockquote> 
				<p>a. The &quot;Station.com&quot; Prize Games 2002 (&quot;Games&quot;) 
				are offered only in the United States to legal residents of the 
				50 United States and the District of Columbia, who are at least 
				18 years of age at time of entry. Void in Puerto Rico, Guam, all 
				other U.S. and foreign territories and possessions and wherever 
				prohibited or restricted by law.</p>
				<p>b. Employees and directors of Sony Online Entertainment Inc. 
				(&quot;SOE&quot;), and its respective parents, affiliated and subsidiary 
				companies, advertising and promotional agencies, web masters and 
				web suppliers and the immediate family (spouse, mother, father, 
				sister, brother, ward, daughter or son) or members of the households 
				of such employees or directors (whether or not related) are not 
				eligible to participate or receive prizes.</p>
				<p>c. By entering, you agree to these Official Rules and the decisions 
				of SOE, which are final and binding in all respects. </p>
				</blockquote>
				<p>2.	<b>Entry</b></p>
				<blockquote> 
				<p>a. No purchase necessary to enter or win. To enter, 
				go to <a href="http://www.station.com">www.station.com</a> Enter 
				the Prize Drawing by (i) logging on to the Web Site; (ii) completing 
				a one-time registration form (registration is free); and (iii) playing 
				any of the Station.com Prize Games listed in Official Rule 2.c herein. 
				When you play the game, text will appear in a Dialog Box to notify 
				you that you may be entered in the Prize Drawing. Individuals who 
				have elected not to receive emails from Station.com (&quot;opt-out&quot;) 
				will not be entered into the drawings. To &quot;opt-in&quot; to 
				or to &quot;opt-out&quot; of receiving emails from Station.com, 
				click <a href="contact_info.jsp">here</a>. Limit forty (40) entries 
				per person per Prize Drawing Day. A Prize Drawing Day begins at 
				12:01 p.m. Pacific Time and ends at 12:00 p.m. the following day. 
				Limit forty (40) entries per person per Prize Drawing Day. A Prize 
				Drawing Day begins at 12:01 p.m. Pacific Time and ends at 12:00 
				p.m. Pacific Time the following day. Odds of winning will depend 
				on the total number of eligible entries received for the drawing.</p>
				<p>b. The terms of these Station.com Prize Games will 
				apply for the period from June 3, 2002, at 12:01 p.m. through December 
				30, 2002, at 12:00 p.m. Check back here in advance of December 30, 
				2002, for Station.com Prize Games promotions available thereafter. 
				</p>
				<p>c. The Station.com Prize Games 2002 games are defined 
				to include: Rock and Roll JEOPARDY! Online, Sports JEOPARDY! Online, 
				Showbiz JEOPARDY! Online, JEOPARDY! Online Techno-files, Classic 
				JEOPARDY! Online, College JEOPARDY! Online, Classic Wheel of Fortune 
				Online, SoapCity Wheel of Fortune Online, College Wheel of Fortune 
				Online, Dating Game Online, Ninety-Nine, Checkers, Spades, Hearts, 
				Osmosis, Solitaire, Four Seasons Solitaire, Parallels Solitaire, 
				Klondike Solitaire, No Dice!, Empyrean II, Patch It!, Saint-Tropez, 
				Classic Scrambles, Super Mine Scramble, Super Space Scramble, Yuetan, 
				Pharaoh's Secret, Rick O'Shea's Adventure, Bingo, Shiver Me Timbers 
				Slots, Yankee Doodle Slots, White Diamonds Slots.</p>
				<p>d. The Station.com Prize Games are expressly defined 
				not to include: Chain Letters, Chain Reaction, Cosmic Rift, EverQuest, 
				EverQuest II, EverQuest Online Adventures, Infantry, PlanetSide, 
				Sovereign, Star Wars Galaxies, Tanarus, Confetti. </p>
				<p>f. Any attempt at entry except as above stated is void. </p>
				<p></p>
				</blockquote>
				<p>3.	<b>Winner Selection and Prize:</b></p>
				<blockquote> 
				<p>a. $100 Daily Prize Drawing. Total daily prize is 
				$100 cash. One (1) winner will be selected each day in a random 
				drawing from among all eligible entries at 12:00 p.m. each day. 
				The Prize Drawing period for each day begins at 12:01 p.m. Pacific 
				Time and ends at 12:00 p.m. the following day. ODDS OF WINNING WILL 
				DEPEND ON THE TOTAL NUMBER OF ELIGIBLE ENTRIES RECEIVED FOR THE 
				INDIVIDUAL DAILY DRAWING. NONWINNING ENTRIES WILL NOT BE ROLLED 
				OVER INTO ANY LATER DRAWINGS. Limit one prize per person in a 30-day 
				period. Total value of all daily prizes: $21,000.00. </p>
				<p>b. $250 Weekly Prize Drawing. Total weekly prize is $250 cash. 
				One (1) winner will be selected each week in a random drawing from 
				among all eligible entries at 12:00 p.m. each Monday. The Prize 
				Drawing period for each week begins at each Monday at 12:01 p.m. 
				Pacific Time and ends at 12:00 p.m. the following Monday. ODDS OF 
				WINNING WILL DEPEND ON THE TOTAL NUMBER OF ELIGIBLE ENTRIES RECEIVED 
				FOR THE INDIVIDUAL WEEKLY DRAWING. NONWINNING ENTRIES WILL NOT BE 
				ROLLED OVER INTO ANY LATER DRAWINGS. Limit one prize per person 
				in a 180-day period. Total value of all weekly prizes: $7,500.00.</p>
				<p>c. Total value of all Station.com Prize Games 2002 prizes: $28,500.00. 
				<br>
				<br>
				d. Prizes will be mailed in the form of checks in U.S. dollars within 
				thirty (30) business days of SOE's receipt of the completed Affidavit 
				of Eligibility and Liability/Publicity Release. No substitution, 
				transfer, or cash equivalent of prize is permitted, except by SOE, 
				which reserves the right to substitute a prize of equal or greater 
				value. Any and all taxes on the prize, and any other costs, fees, 
				and expenses not explicitly stated herein, are the sole responsibility 
				of the prize recipient. These Games are governed by U.S. law and 
				are subject to all federal, state and local laws and regulations. 
				All times listed herein are pacific standard time.</p>
				</blockquote>
				<p>4.	<b>Winner Notification and Affidavit of Eligibility with Liability/Publicity Release</b></p>
				<blockquote> 
				<p>a. The selected winner will be notified by email. 
				The selected winner will have 72 hours from the moment such notification 
				is issued to respond to such notification by following the instructions 
				provided therein. If a potential winner timely responds to such 
				notification, he/she will be sent an Affidavit of Eligibility with 
				Liability/Publicity Release and must, within five (5) days of issuance, 
				complete, sign and return all required documentation (including 
				full legal name, address, social security number and date of birth). 
				If the potential winner does not reply to the notification within 
				72 hours of its issuance, does not return the signed documents within 
				five (5) days of their issuance, is ineligible, or cannot or does 
				not comply with these official rules, then he/she will be disqualified, 
				the prize will be forfeited and an alternate winner may be selected, 
				at SOE's discretion, in a second chance drawing of all eligible 
				entries received during the Prize Drawing period.<br>
				<br>
				b. By accepting a prize, all entrants and winners consent to the 
				use of their names, voices, pictures or other likeness for advertising, 
				promotional and other purposes as determined by SOE without further 
				approval or compensation.</p>
				<p>c. All participants, by entering these Games, agree to release 
				and hold harmless SOE, its parents, subsidiaries, affiliates, distributors, 
				suppliers, officers, directors, shareholders and agents (collectively, 
				the &quot;Releasees&quot;) from and against any and all losses, 
				damages, rights, claims and actions of any kind in connection with 
				the Games or resulting from acceptance, possession, or use or misuse 
				of any prize(s) including, without limitation, personal injuries, 
				death, property damage, and claims based on publicity rights, defamation, 
				or invasion of privacy and merchandise delivery. By entering these 
				Games and /or accepting a prize, all entrants and winners consent 
				to the use of their names, voices, pictures or other likeness for 
				advertising, promotional and other purposes as determined by SOE 
				without further approval or compensation.</p>
				</blockquote>
				<p>5.	<b>Limitations of Liability</b></p>
				<blockquote> 
				<p>a. The Releasees are not responsible for any incorrect 
				or inaccurate entry information, whether caused by Web Site users 
				or by any of the equipment or programming associated with or utilized 
				in the Games, and the Releasees assume no responsibility for any 
				error, omission, interruption, deletion, defect, or delay in operation 
				or transmission at the Web Site or any web site related to the Games, 
				or for communications line failure, or for theft or destruction, 
				tampering, or unauthorized access to entries and/or entry information. 
				The Releasees are not responsible for any problems or technical, 
				hardware, or software malfunctions of any telephone network or telephone 
				lines, failed, incorrect, inaccurate, incomplete, garbled or delayed 
				electronic communications whether caused by the sender or by any 
				of the equipment or programming associated with or utilized in these 
				Games, computer online systems, servers or providers, computer equipment, 
				software, failure of any email or entry to be received by SOE due 
				to technical problems, human error or traffic congestion, unavailable 
				network connections on the Internet or at any website, or any combination 
				thereof, including any injury or damage to participant's or any 
				other person's computer relating to or resulting from participating 
				in these Games or downloading any materials in these Games.</p>
				<p>b. SOE reserves the right, at its sole discretion, to disqualify 
				any individual it finds to be tampering with the entry process or 
				the operation of the Games or the Web Site or any web site related 
				to the Games; to be acting in violation of the Official Rules; or 
				to be acting in a non-sportsmanlike or disruptive manner, or with 
				intent to annoy, abuse, threaten or harass any other person. Any 
				use of robotic, macro, automatic, programmed or the like entry methods 
				will void all such entries by such methods. In the event of a dispute 
				as to entries submitted by multiple users having the same email 
				account, the authorized subscriber of the email account used to 
				enter the Prize Drawing at the actual time of registration will 
				be deemed to be the participant and must comply with these rules. 
				Authorized account subscriber is deemed to be the natural person 
				who is assigned an email address by an Internet access provider, 
				on-line service provider or other organization that is responsible 
				for assigning email address for the domain associated with the submitted 
				email address. Potential winner may be required to provide SOE with 
				proof that the potential winner is the authorized account holder 
				of the email address associated with the potentially winning entry.</p>
				<p>c. If, for any reason, the Games are not capable of running as 
				planned by reason of infection by computer virus, bugs, worms, tampering, 
				unauthorized intervention, fraud, tampering, technical failures, 
				or any other causes beyond the control of SOE which, in the sole 
				opinion of SOE, corrupt or affect the administration, security, 
				fairness, integrity or proper conduct of the Games, SOE reserves 
				the right, at its sole discretion, to void suspect entries and/or 
				to cancel, terminate, modify or suspend the Games and select the 
				winner from among all eligible, non-suspect entries received prior 
				to such cancellation, termination or suspension. IN NO EVENT WILL 
				THE RELEASEES BE RESPONSIBLE OR LIABLE FOR ANY DAMAGES OR LOSSES 
